PROJECT: Helium

Core Insights

Insight 1: Fair Launch Murni Menghindari Tekanan Jual Awal dan Risiko Regulasi Sekuritas
Explanation: Helium meluncurkan mainnet 2019-07-29 dengan 0% pre-mine, 0% alokasi tim, 0% alokasi investor, 0% alokasi foundation. Semua HNT diekspor via proof-of-coverage (PoC) mulai blok 1. Investor hanya memegang equity Nova Labs Inc., bukan token. Desain ini menghilangkan cliff/vesting unlock yang menciptakan tekanan jual masif dan mengurangi risiko klasifikasi token sebagai security di bawah Howey Test karena tidak ada "investment of money in common enterprise dengan expectation of profit from efforts of others" pada TGE【Phase 3 — EV-007】【Phase 6 — TGE】【Phase 6 — Distribution】【Phase 9 — Keputusan: Fair Launch Mainnet Genesis tanpa Pre-mine/Pre-sale】
Evidence: Tokenomics whitepaper menyatakan "no pre-mine, no ICO, no pre-sale"; genesis supply 0; emisi dimulai via PoC reward【Phase 6 — TGE】【Phase 6 — Distribution】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 1 Foundation, Phase 3 EV-007, Phase 5 Token Sale, Phase 6 TGE, Distribution, Phase 9 Fair Launch Decision
Confidence: HIGH

Insight 2: Migrasi State Penuh ke Solana (Bukan Bridge) Menghilangkan Fragmentasi Likuiditas dan Beban Konsensus
Explanation: HIP 70 dieksekusi 2023-04-18 memigrasikan seluruh state (900k+ Hotspot accounts, balances, PoC history) ke Solana programs via one-time state export. Legacy mainnet dihentikan sepenuhnya. Tidak ada dua chain paralel dengan bridge. HNT/IOT/MOBILE menjadi SPL token native Solana. Konsensus diserahkan ke Solana validator set (ribuan node, >$B stake)【Phase 3 — EV-022】【Phase 4 — Architecture】【Phase 4 — Consensus Mechanism】【Phase 9 — Pola 4: Migrasi Blockchain via State Export/Import】
Evidence: HIP 70 design "state migration" bukan "bridge"; legacy mainnet dihentikan 2023-04-18; Hotspot identity dipertahankan via account mapping【Phase 3 — EV-019】【Phase 3 — EV-022】【Phase 4 — Architecture】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-019, EV-022, Phase 4 Architecture, Consensus Mechanism, Technical Upgrade History, Phase 9 Migration Pattern
Confidence: HIGH

Insight 3: Proof-of-Coverage (PoC) Menggunakan Verifikasi Fisik RF Bukan Staking Ekonomis Sebagai Sybil Resistance
Explanation: PoC mechanism memverifikasi assert coverage Hotspot via oracle off-chain yang memvalidasi RSSI, SNR, GPS, timing secara kriptografis. Reward berbasis kualitas coverage nyata, bukan stake weight. Secure element (ATECC608B/TEE) mandatory di setiap Hotspot untuk menandatangani assert lokasi/coverage【Phase 4 — Core Components PoC Oracle Network】【Phase 4 — Consensus Mechanism PoC】【Phase 4 — Security Model PoC Verification】【Phase 9 — Pola 2: Proof-of-Coverage sebagai Sybil Resistance Fisik】
Evidence: Oracle network off-chain memverifikasi assert coverage; reward berbasis kualitas coverage bukan stake weight; secure element mandatory【Phase 4 — Core Components】【Phase 4 — Security Model】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4 Core Components, Consensus Mechanism, Security Model, Phase 9 PoC Pattern
Confidence: HIGH

Insight 4: SubDAO Structure (HIP 51/52) Memisahkan Tokenomics IoT vs Mobile untuk Alignment Insentif per Sub-Jaringan
Explanation: HIP 51 (SubDAOs generik) dan HIP 52 (Mobile SubDAO) disetujui 2022-05 memisahkan emisi IOT untuk Hotspot LoRaWAN dan emisi MOBILE untuk Gateway 5G/WiFi. Treasury, governance, dan parameter emisi terpisah per SubDAO. Mengatasi kompleksitas dua jaringan fisik dengan ekonomi unit berbeda di bawah satu token HNT【Phase 3 — EV-017】【Phase 6 — Distribution】【Phase 6 — Governance】【Phase 6 — Inflation/Deflation】【Phase 9 — Keputusan: HIP 51 & HIP 52 — SubDAO Structure】
Evidence: HIP 51 membuat framework SubDAO generik; HIP 52 mendefinisikan Mobile SubDAO; token IOT dan MOBILE terpisah dari HNT induk; governance & treasury terpisah【Phase 3 — EV-017】【Phase 6 — Distribution】【Phase 6 — Governance】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-017, Phase 6 Distribution, Governance, Inflation/Deflation, Phase 9 SubDAO Decision
Confidence: HIGH

Insight 5: Helium Mobile MVNO Menciptakan Permintaan Data Credits Nyata (Real-World Demand) untuk Flywheel BME
Explanation: Peluncuran Helium Mobile 2023-06 dengan roaming T-Mobile nasional ($20/bulan unlimited) mengubah fiat revenue menjadi DC burn (MOBILE/HNT). Sebelumnya IoT DC burn volume terlalu rendah untuk Burn-and-Mint Equilibrium (BME). MVNO menjadi produk B2C pertama monetisasi jaringan DePIN【Phase 3 — EV-023】【Phase 3 — EV-024】【Phase 5 — Revenue Model】【Phase 6 — Utility】【Phase 9 — Keputusan: Peluncuran Helium Mobile MVNO】
Evidence: Helium Mobile launch blog 2023-06; partnership T-Mobile; $20/unlimited plan; revenue fiat → DC burn MOBILE/HNT【Phase 3 — EV-023】【Phase 5 — Revenue Model】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-023, EV-024, Phase 5 Revenue Model, Phase 6 Utility, Phase 9 Mobile MVNO Decision
Confidence: HIGH

Insight 6: VC Funding Bootstrap ($311M+ Series A-D) Lalu Beralih ke Tokenomics Sebagai Sustainability Mechanism
Explanation: Series A 2018 (USV/Khosla), Series B 2019 (Multicoin), Series C $111M 2020 (GV), Series D $200M 2021 (a16z/Tiger Global) mendanai R&D, hardware supply chain, team scaling. Zero token sale. Protocol revenue via DC burn dan Mobile subscription mengambil alih jangka panjang【Phase 5 — Funding History】【Phase 5 — Fundraising Mechanism】【Phase 5 — Revenue Model】【Phase 9 — Pola 1: VC Funding untuk Bootstrap, Tokenomics untuk Sustainability】
Evidence: 4 ronde VC total $311M+ yang diungkap; zero token sale; investor equity only; protocol revenue via DC burn dan Mobile subscription【Phase 5 — Funding History】【Phase 5 — Fundraising Mechanism】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 5 Funding History, Fundraising Mechanism, Revenue Model, Financial Dependencies, Phase 9 Funding Pattern
Confidence: HIGH

Insight 7: Arsitektur Modular dengan Layer Settlement Terpisah Memungkinkan Upgrade Konsensus Tanpa Mengganggu Application Logic
Explanation: Custom L1 2019-2023 (HoneyBadgerBFT) hanya untuk consensus & state; application logic (PoC, rewards, SubDAO, DC) di node software. Migrasi HIP 70 memindahkan application logic ke Solana programs (BPF/Anchor) sementara consensus diserahkan ke Solana validator set【Phase 4 — Architecture】【Phase 4 — Consensus Mechanism】【Phase 4 — Execution Environment】【Phase 9 — Pola 1: Arsitektur Modular dengan Layer Settlement Terpisah】
Evidence: Custom L1 hanya untuk consensus & state; application logic di node software; migrasi memindahkan logic ke Solana programs【Phase 4 — Architecture】【Phase 4 — Consensus Mechanism】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4 Architecture, Consensus Mechanism, Execution Environment, Phase 9 Modular Architecture Pattern
Confidence: HIGH

Insight 8: Secure Element Hardware Root of Trust Mandatori Mencegah Kloning dan Spoofing Lokasi Fisik
Explanation: Setiap Hotspot bersertifikat wajib memasang ATECC608B/TEE menyimpan private key identity (Ed25519) tidak diekspor, menandatangani assert lokasi (GPS signed) dan coverage. Kudelski Security audit berkelanjutan side-channel resistance, secure boot, supply chain attestation【Phase 4 — Core Components Secure Element】【Phase 4 — Security Model Secure Element】【Phase 4 — Audit History Kudelski】【Phase 9 — Pola 5: Secure Element Hardware Root of Trust Mandatori】
