Supporting Dataset: Phase 4 Core Components, Security Model, Audit History, Phase 9 Hardware Security Pattern
Confidence: HIGH

Insight 9: Multi-RAT Expansion Bertahap (LoRaWAN → 5G CBRS → WiFi Passpoint) Di Bawah SubDAO Mobile Tunggal
Explanation: Perluasan teknologi radio: IoT LoRaWAN (sub-GHz, 2019) → Mobile 5G CBRS (3.5 GHz, 2021) → Mobile WiFi Passpoint (2.4/5/6 GHz, 2024). Semua 5G + WiFi reward MOBILE via Mobile SubDAO. Memanfaatkan spektrum unlicensed untuk WiFi memperluas addressable market beyond CBRS【Phase 3 — EV-012】【Phase 3 — EV-026】【Phase 4 — Core Components】【Phase 7 — Major Integrations WiFi】【Phase 9 — Pola 5: Multi-RAT Expansion】
Evidence: Product timeline: Helium Hotspot LoRaWAN 2019, Helium 5G 2021, Helium WiFi 2024; Mobile SubDAO mengelola 5G + WiFi rewards【Phase 3 — EV-012】【Phase 3 — EV-026】【Phase 4 — Core Components】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-012, EV-026, Phase 4 Core Components, Phase 7 Major Integrations, Phase 9 Multi-RAT Pattern
Confidence: HIGH

Insight 10: Governance Multi-Layer (Off-chain HIP → On-chain SPL Governance/Realms) dengan Delegation
Explanation: Proposal HIP didiskusikan off-chain (GitHub, Discord, Forum), voting on-chain via SPL Governance (Realms) menggunakan staked HNT/IOT/MOBILE voting power. Delegation didukung (token holder mendelegasikan voting power ke delegate tanpa transfer token). SubDAO treasury dikendalikan on-chain via governance【Phase 6 — Governance】【Phase 7 — Major Integrations SPL Governance】【Phase 9 — Decision Framework Observe→Evaluate→Fund→Develop→Launch→Govern】
