Strategic Principles

Principle 1: Fair Launch Murni — 0% Alokasi Tim/Investor/Foundation pada TGE
Explanation: Tidak ada pre-mine, pre-sale, team allocation, investor allocation, foundation allocation. 100% token diekspor via PoC mining. Menghindari tekanan jual awal dan risiko regulasi sekuritas【Phase 5 — Token Sale】【Phase 6 — Distribution】【Phase 6 — TGE】【Phase 9 — Pola 2: Fair Launch Murni】
Evidence: Tokenomics whitepaper explicit "no pre-mine, no ICO"; genesis supply 0; HNT emission mulai block 1 via PoC; IOT/MOBILE emission mulai post-migration via SubDAO PoC【Phase 5 — Token Sale】【Phase 6 — Distribution】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 5 Token Sale, Phase 6 Distribution, TGE, Vesting Schedule, Phase 9 Fair Launch Pattern
Confidence: HIGH

Principle 2: Modular First — Pisahkan Consensus/Settlement Layer dari Application Logic
Explanation: Application logic (PoC, rewards, SubDAO, DC) diimplementasikan sebagai programs yang portable. Konsensus bisa diganti (custom L1 → Solana) tanpa menulis ulang application logic【Phase 4 — Architecture】【Phase 4 — Consensus Mechanism】【Phase 9 — Pola 1: Arsitektur Modular】
Evidence: Custom L1 hanya untuk consensus & state; application logic di node software; migrasi memindahkan logic ke Solana programs【Phase 4 — Architecture】【Phase 4 — Consensus Mechanism】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4 Architecture, Consensus Mechanism, Execution Environment, Phase 9 Modular Architecture Pattern
Confidence: HIGH

Principle 3: Physical Verification Over Economic Staking untuk Sybil Resistance
Explanation: Menggunakan verifikasi RF (RSSI, SNR, GPS, timing) via oracle off-chain sebagai bukti lokasi dan coverage nyata, bukan sekadar staking token. Secure element hardware mandatory【Phase 4 — Core Components PoC Oracle Network】【Phase 4 — Security Model PoC Verification】【Phase 9 — Pola 2: Proof-of-Coverage sebagai Sybil Resistance Fisik】
Evidence: PoC mechanism desde mainnet 2019; oracle network off-chain memverifikasi assert coverage Hotspot; reward berbasis kualitas coverage bukan stake weight【Phase 4 — Core Components】【Phase 4 — Security Model】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4 Core Components, Consensus Mechanism, Security Model, Phase 9 PoC Pattern
Confidence: HIGH

Principle 4: Ecosystem Partnerships Over Vertical Manufacturing
Explanation: Bermitra dengan produsen hardware OEM bersertifikat (RAKwireless, Bobcat, Nebra, FreedomFi) untuk produksi/distribusi; Nova Labs menyediakan firmware, certification, secure element provisioning. Hanya mengakuisisi FreedomFi 2022 untuk internalisasi 5G hardware kritis【Phase 2 — Entities hardware partners】【Phase 3 — EV-010】【Phase 3 — EV-018】【Phase 9 — Pola 1: Hardware OEM Partnership Model】
Evidence: Approved hardware list docs; RAKwireless/Bobcat/Nebra dominate supply 2021-2022; FreedomFi acquired 2022 untuk internalisasi 5G hardware; Nova Labs tidak memproduksi IoT hardware sendiri post-2021【Phase 2 — Entities】【Phase 3 — EV-010】【Phase 3 — EV-018】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 2 Entities, Phase 3 EV-010, EV-018, Phase 4 Core Components, External Dependencies, Phase 9 Hardware Partnership Pattern
Confidence: HIGH

Principle 5: Regulatory-First Approach untuk Spectrum Access dan MVNO Operations
Explanation: Proaktif compliance FCC Part 96 CBRS, SAS registration untuk Gateway 5G, carrier-grade compliance untuk MVNO, DeWi alliance untuk policy advocacy. T-Mobile roaming agreement untuk nationwide fallback【Phase 2 — Entities FCC, CBRS Alliance】【Phase 3 — EV-012】【Phase 7 — External Dependencies FCC, SAS, T-Mobile, DeWi】【Phase 9 — Pola 2: Regulatory-First Approach】
