Principle 6: Deep Integration dengan Settlement Layer Ecosystem (Solana DeFi Composability)
Explanation: Memilih Solana sebagai single settlement layer; memanfaatkan DeFi composability (Orca, Raydium, Jupiter, Marinade, Jito), SPL Governance (Realms), SVM performance. Tidak membangun DeFi sendiri【Phase 3 — EV-022】【Phase 4 — Architecture】【Phase 7 — Major Integrations, Infrastructure Providers, Exchange Ecosystem】【Phase 9 — Pola 3: Solana Ecosystem Deep Integration】
