Principle 7: Revenue Diversification — On-chain DC Burn + Off-chain Fiat Revenue (MVNO)
Explanation: Dua aliran revenue: (1) Data Credits burn HNT/IOT/MOBILE on-chain (value accrual ke holders via supply reduction), (2) Helium Mobile fiat subscription $20/mo → dikonversi Nova Labs ke DC burn. Tidak ada buyback program, mengandalkan BME organik【Phase 5 — Revenue Model】【Phase 6 — Utility】【Phase 6 — Inflation/Deflation】【Phase 9 — Pola 5: Revenue Diversification】
