Explanation: Memisahkan auditor berdasarkan domain: Trail of Bits audit kode migrasi Solana, program SPL, staking, PoC oracle, SubDAO treasury (2022-11, 19 temuan 2 Critical dimitigasi). Kudelski Security audit berkelanjutan hardware/firmware: secure element side-channel, secure boot, supply chain attestation【Phase 4 — Audit History】【Phase 9 — Pola 6: Auditor Specialization】
